3. UNKNOWN-UNTIL-FIRST-RUN — the vault question on shared TEST.
   Once (1) is resolved, the next arm that can fire is V1-SETUP:
   -> TEST FAILED (V1-SETUP), carrying the SQLSTATE and message it observed
   CAUSE, if it fires: on the pg-lane `vault.decrypted_secrets` is the stand-in
   TABLE from scripts/pg-lane/fixtures/32-fixture-vault-stand-in.sql; on TEST it
